{"DatoH karmaRaH samanakartfkadicCayan va": [{"id": "DAtoH karmaRaH samAnakartfkAdicCAyAM vA", "headword": "धातोः कर्मणः समानकर्तृकादिच्छायां वा", "headword_slp1": "DAtoH karmaRaH samAnakartfkAdicCAyAM vA", "fold": "DatoH karmaRaH samanakartfkadicCayan va", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix is optionally attached, in the sense of 'wishing' after a root expressing the object wished and having the same agent of the action as the wisher thereof.\n\nTerms: Desiderative", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["धातोः कर्मणः समानकर्तृकादिच्छायां वा ३.१.७", "३.१.७", "३.१.७ धातोः कर्मणः समानकर्तृकादिच्छायां वा"], "synonyms_slp1": ["DAtoH karmaRaH samAnakartfkAdicCAyAM vA ३.१.७", "३.१.७", "३.१.७ DAtoH karmaRaH samAnakartfkAdicCAyAM vA"]}], "Datorekaco haladeH kriyasamaBihare yaN": [{"id": "DAtorekAco halAdeH kriyAsamaBihAre yaN", "headword": "धातोरेकाचो हलादेः क्रियासमभिहारे यङ्", "headword_slp1": "DAtorekAco halAdeH kriyAsamaBihAre yaN", "fold": "Datorekaco haladeH kriyasamaBihare yaN", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix वङ् , in the sense of repitition of the act, comes after a root, having a single vowel and beginning with a consonant.\n\nTerms: वङ्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["धातोरेकाचो हलादेः क्रियासमभिहारे यङ् ३.१.२२", "३.१.२२", "३.१.२२ धातोरेकाचो हलादेः क्रियासमभिहारे यङ्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["DAtorekAco halAdeH kriyAsamaBihAre yaN ३.१.२२", "३.१.२२", "३.१.२२ DAtorekAco halAdeH kriyAsamaBihAre yaN"]}], "DatoH": [{"id": "DAtoH", "headword": "धातोः", "headword_slp1": "DAtoH", "fold": "DatoH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "As far as the end of the Third Chapter reckoning from the present sūtra, the affixes treated of are to be understood as coming after some verbal root. (Note: This is an अधिकार सूत्र। All these verbal affixes are broadly classified as कृत् and कृत्य affixes)\n\nTerms: अधिकार सूत्र", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "A root has the acute on the end syllable.\n\nTerms: accent", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["धातोः ३.१.९१", "धातोः ६.१.१६२", "३.१.९१", "३.१.९१ धातोः", "६.१.१६२", "६.१.१६२ धातोः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["DAtoH ३.१.९१", "DAtoH ६.१.१६२", "३.१.९१", "३.१.९१ DAtoH", "६.१.१६२", "६.१.१६२ DAtoH"]}], "DatusambanDe pratyayaH": [{"id": "DAtusambanDe pratyayAH", "headword": "धातुसम्बन्धे प्रत्ययाः", "headword_slp1": "DAtusambanDe pratyayAH", "fold": "DatusambanDe pratyayaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "When there is a syntactical relation between the senses of the verbs, the affixes are valid, even in denoting time other than that for which they have been specifically enjoined.\n\nTerms:", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["धातुसम्बन्धे प्रत्ययाः ३.४.१", "३.४.१", "३.४.१ धातुसम्बन्धे प्रत्ययाः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["DAtusambanDe pratyayAH ३.४.१", "३.४.१", "३.४.१ DAtusambanDe pratyayAH"]}], "DatvadeH saH saH": [{"id": "DAtvAdeH zaH saH", "headword": "धात्वादेः षः सः", "headword_slp1": "DAtvAdeH zaH saH", "fold": "DatvadeH saH saH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "There is the substitution of स in the room of the ष् being the initial of a verbal root as enunciated in the धातुपाठ।\n\nTerms:", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["धात्वादेः षः सः ६.१.६४", "६.१.६४", "६.१.६४ धात्वादेः षः सः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["DAtvAdeH zaH saH ६.१.६४", "६.१.६४", "६.१.६४ DAtvAdeH zaH saH"]}], "DatostanimitasyEva": [{"id": "DAtostannimittasyEva", "headword": "धातोस्तन्निमित्तस्यैव", "headword_slp1": "DAtostannimittasyEva", "fold": "DatostanimitasyEva", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "For the final dipthongs ओ and औ of a root, are substituted अव् and आव् respectively, before an affix beginning with य् , then only when such dipthong has been itself first evolved by that affix.\n\nTerms: संहितायाम्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["धातोस्तन्निमित्तस्यैव ६.१.८०", "६.१.८०", "६.१.८० धातोस्तन्निमित्तस्यैव"], "synonyms_slp1": ["DAtostannimittasyEva ६.१.८०", "६.१.८०", "६.१.८० DAtostannimittasyEva"]}]}